# The PO's exported verdicts. Kept OUT of the repo deliberately: they are an input to a pass, not a
# record of one, and re-exporting mid-pass would churn the diff. `source-map.json`, `alternates.json`
# and `source-audit.json` ARE committed — those are derived facts about the library, not opinions.
animation-review.csv
alternate-picks.json
